[Music]  we probably all agree that Maddie  Ziegler is nothing like she used to be  she went from being a bratty and  dramatic reality TV show star to  becoming well you'll see if there's one  thing we know for sure is that Maddie's  transformation is downright spectacular  but would you really expect anything  else from Abby's favorite student yeah  we didn't think so it's about the kids  and about them shining onstage and not  them becoming stars Maddie Ziegler was  groomed for stardom at a very young age  she began mastering her footwork at the  Abby Lee dance company when she was only  two years old Maddie's a natural and  she's super dedicated to her craft  making her the perfect student in Abby  Lee Miller's eyes Maddie may have been  at the top of the pyramid more often  than anyone else but that never stopped  her from shedding tears and causing  scenes during her time on Dance Moms  Maddie quickly became known for being a  dramatic student who had exceptionally  high expectations of herself being  compared to her friends and intensely  scrutinized by every mom on the show  didn't do much for Maddie's personality  but her committed ways natural-born  talent and passion turned her into a  big-time star in no time and guys this  is just the tip of the iceberg nothing  kick starts a career like the  endorsement of a renowned celebrity and  in a way this is exactly what happened  to Maddie in 2014 SIA contacted Maddie  via Twitter asking if she wanted to play  her in the video for her first single  SIA was a fan of Dance Moms and quickly  fell in love with Maddie's facial  expressions and stellar dancing  abilities she first appeared in the  music video for chandelier and as Sia's  fame grew and grew so did Maddie's SIA  and Maddie have been inseparable ever  since  Maddie continuously plays her in her  music videos and even dances for her  during stage performances they have a  super close relationship why else would  see you buy Maddie a brand new car for  her 16th birthday  SIA and Abby Lee Miller might have  turned Maddie into a star but in reality  her star quality speaks for itself  before long everyone wanted to meet the  girl who was dancing her way through  Hollywood Maddie appeared on Dance Moms  from 2011 to 2016 during this time she  also danced on the view and made  appearances on Entertainment Tonight and  Good Morning America but her career  really kick-started when she chose to  leave Dance Moms behind and explore new  horizons she went on to become a guest  judge on So You Think You Can Dance in  2016 and dance for the audience's of the  Ellen DeGeneres Show she's appeared on  so many talk shows TV series and movies  that it's hard to keep track but being a  socialite and talented performer aren't  the only thing she's got in the bag  turns out she's a business person too  and an aspiring actress as well how else  would she get on Steven Spielberg's  radar you know you've made it when you  publish a memoir at only 14 years old  the Maddie Diaries quickly became a New  York Times bestseller her fans jumped at  the chance to get the inside scoop on  what really happened during her time on  Dance Moms despite her young age Maddie  had a lot to say about her upbringing  which was jam-packed with rehearsals  dance competitions and public  appearances during an interview with  build series Maddie opened up about why  she chose to write a memoir according to  the star she felt as though a lot of  people thought they knew everything  about her when in reality that was far  from the truth the Maddie Diaries gives  fans the inside scoop and also shows  them that despite all the fame and  glamour Maddie's a normal teenage girl  just when we thought that Maddie  couldn't get any bigger she turns around  and partners up with Kate Hudson is the  most incredible actor and she's probably  as my biggest inspiration in life in  2019 Maddie and Kate announced that they  had teamed up to work on a  limited-edition collection 